            "notes": "We sell [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) to grab [Goddess's Aura](item_a36d46c8-cee0-4c97-b6e4-72bb816c13dc) because this mean's more survivability. We put [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) in it's place to keep that cooldown reduction while also supporting some dmg for our dps. \n\nRemember, this is not a kiri-dps build. We are supporting as All-father Rein intended. We still spam swift step, but then afterwards maybe we go for some slick picks.",
