            "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:50:08.836526+00:00",
            "notes": "Because you should be getting 2-3 ults per round now, it's really best to go for [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f). If you wanted to be selfish you could go for [Spirit Veil](item_1772ce7d-37ed-41e4-8bac-d9b260aa59ad) or [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) for that extra-unkillable-rat feeling, but slowing the whole team (if you get them in there) with Kitsune is just *chef's kiss*.\n\nEven though we lose some cooldown reduction, the extra AP along with all the ultimates you should be getting, this is the best option for the team. It ensures that if everyone hits their shots and does their part, every Kitsune will be a winning team fight which is necessary for this last round. Just look for the best opportunities to pop it on the whole team and you'll do great!",
